{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119874","id":3769948716,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7gtNos","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119874","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119874.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119874.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119874","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119874/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119874/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119874/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e3b13474d7677891898afcf42e5e418443b6082b","number":119874,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add max_global_polyphony setting to AudioStreamPlayer and option to bypass it","user":{"login":"BigFudgeDev","id":165416054,"node_id":"U_kgDOCdwMdg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165416054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev","html_url":"https://github.com/BigFudgeDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BigFudgeDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#13892\r\n\r\nIntroduces a global limit to concurrently playing sounds, on top of the per-node limit that already exists. It can be configured via ProjectSettings.audio/general/max_global_polyphony. It also introduces a per-node bypass option, `AudioStreamPlayer.bypass_global_polyphony`, for sounds like music and ambient SFX that should not be interrupted.\r\n\r\nWhen `AudioServer::start_playback_stream()` is called and the number of currently active playbacks meets or exceeds max_global_polyphony, the server first iterates its active playback list and then finds and stops the oldest playback. However, playbacks with the bypass flag set are never evicted and do not count toward the voice limit.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2e9ff71-9bda-46de-826a-1d6f8f224e02\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga